                    "value": "Hourly transaction volume follows almost the same curve on weekdays and weekends alike — both climb sharply from the 6 AM open, peak between roughly 8–10 AM at more than double the volume of any other hour, then settle into a flatter midday plateau before tapering off sharply after 6 PM. The near-total overlap between the two series at every hour suggests day-of-week has little influence on when customers show up.",
